          <div class=\"section-header\">New Products</div>\n   448→\n   449→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   450→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   451→                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n   452→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/ab-613/opengravity\" target=\"_blank\">OpenGravity</a>\n   453→                        </div>\n   454→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   455→                            A zero-install, BYOK vanilla JS clone of Antigravity - full AI IDE with WebContainer API integration for real terminal environments. Built to avoid usage limits on closed-source AI IDEs.\n   456→                        </div>\n   457→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   458→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n   459→                            <span class=\"tag\">Show HN</span>\n   460→                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 12</span>\n   461→                        </div>\n   462→                    </div>\n   463→\n   464→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   465→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   466→                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n   467→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/decolua/9router\" target=\"_blank\">9router</a>\n   468→                        </div>\n   469→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   470→                            Unlimited FREE AI coding router that connects Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Cline, Copilot, and Antigravity to 40+ free API providers. Features auto-fallback and 40% token reduction via RTK.\n   471→                        </div>\n   472→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   473→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   474→                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub Trending</span>\n   475→                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 8</span>\n   476→                        </div>\n   477→                    </div>\n   478→\n   479→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   480→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   481→                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n   482→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/adamjgmiller/adamsreview\" target=\"_blank\">adamsreview</a>\n   483→                        </div>\n   484→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   485→                            Claude Code plugin for multi-stage PR reviews using parallel sub-agents, validation passes, persistent JSON state, and optional ensemble review via Codex CLI. Catches more real bugs with fewer false positives.\n   486→                        </div>\n   487→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   488→                            <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n   489→                            <span class=\"tag\">Show HN</span>\n   490→                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 11</span>\n   491→                        </div>\n   492→                    </div>\n   493→\n   494→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   495→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   496→                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n   497→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/rohitg00/agentmemory\" target=\"_blank\">agentmemory</a>\n   498→                        </div>\n   499→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   500→                            #1 Persistent memory system for AI coding agents based on real-world benchmarks. Enables project-long memory across sessions for AI agents, solving the context loss problem.\n   501→                        </div>\n   502→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   503→                            <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n   504→                  