ent Stack from ByteDance. Connects cutting-edge AI models with agent infrastructure for desktop automation and coding workflows.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/millionco/react-doctor\" target=\"_blank\">react-doctor</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Your agent writes bad React. This catches it - a specialized linter for detecting and fixing AI-generated React code quality issues.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific AI tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/salmanjavaid/rapunzel\" target=\"_blank\">Rapunzel</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A tree-style tab terminal emulator designed for Codex, Claude, and Gemini AI coding assistants. Helps manage multiple terminal sessions when working with AI coding CLIs.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Show HN</span>\n                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 11</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/graphbit-prflow\" target=\"_blank\">Graphbit PRFlow - AI Code Review Agent</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI code review agent that automates PR reviews with workflow orchestration. Integrates into development workflows to catch bugs before merge.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span class=\"timestamp\">May 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"upvote\">▲</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://producthunt.com/posts/kilo-code\" target=\"_blank\">Kilo Code v7 for VS Code</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI coding assistant deeply integrated into VS Code. Provides AI-powered code completion, refactoring, and workflow assistance within the existing IDE.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">IDE-integrated AI tools</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n   